function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

[a|] type means: @intrinsic("type", "type")

[a|] byte means: @intrinsic("type", "int", 8)

[a|] pointer to pointed means: @intrinsic("add pointer depth", pointed)

the identity of {type:value} means: @intrinsic("select", @intrinsic("equal", 0, 0), value, value)

ignore @intrinsic("size of", the identity of a pointer to a byte)
